@baseUrl = http://localhost:5210
# Replace with the "id" returned by request 1.
@id = 000000000000000000000000

### Health -> { "status": "ok" }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 1. Create a conversation -> 201 { "id", "title" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Trip planning" }

### 2. Send a message
### -> 200 { "reply", "storedMessageCount", "messagesSentToModel", "promptPreview", "summaryRefreshed" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "I'm planning a 3-day trip to Rome in October. Any suggestions?" }

### 3. Newest transcript page. "limit" counts turns (default 20, maximum 100).
### -> 200 { "id", "title", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "messages", "storedMessageCount", "nextBeforeSequence" }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{id}}?limit=2

### 4. Older page. Use "nextBeforeSequence" from the previous response. The cursor is exclusive.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{id}}?limit=2&beforeSequence=4

### 5. Blank text -> 400 { "message" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "   " }

### 6. Unknown conversation -> 404 { "message" }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/68a0000000000000000000aa
